blurry-b 2026-11-26: marker.png and chest_open.png re-traced to clean vector shapes (palette-quantised, potrace, re-rendered as a 512px transparent PNG at ~90%, hard anti-aliased edges, no fading; tool tools/sprite_vec.py) from the existing video crop, because no copy of the same image was found online.
bl-2 2026-11-26: wall.jpg: procedural redraw at 512px of the video's dark slate wall tile with the same brick layout (2 over 3, light top edge, dark grout, faint noise; tools/bl2/tiles.py).
fin-sprites-b 2026-11-26 (tools/fsb/batch2_pp.py): wB.png / wP.png rendered with tools/g3d_staunton.py geometry in the player's dark glossy slate (were blurry pale cuts re-shaded dark; no video frame shows them), 512px. gold.png = game-icons.net 'gold-nuggets' by Delapouite (CC BY 3.0) with a gold gradient, transparent 512px (was a smudge on a baked dark square). New orb.png = transparent glowing green healing orb drawn to the sp_orb icon's design, used for the board 'Healing orb' piece; sp_orb.png stays as the HUD spell icon. HUD icons it_blade/it_potion/it_staff/sp_lesser/sp_greater/sp_orb kept: they are the game's own painterly icons and the largest public source (Steam 1920x1080 screenshots, store app 3210650) shows them at ~40px, below our 96px copies.
